message: "If you use these tools in teaching or research, please cite them as below."
title: "Interactive Math Teaching Tools"
abstract: >-
  40+ real-time, browser-based interactive applications for teaching and
  learning Differential Equations, Linear Algebra, and Numerical Methods,
  including phase portraits, linear-algebra calculators, mass-spring-damping
  simulators, polynomial interpolation, and finite-difference schemes.
type: software
